.TE
.PP
\f[CR]time\f[R] has been deprecated in favor of
\f[CR]time_remaining\f[R].
.SS Examples
Basic usage:
.IP
.EX
\f[B][[block]]\f[R]
block = \[dq]battery\[dq]
format = \[dq] $icon $percentage \[dq]
.EE
.IP
.EX
\f[B][[block]]\f[R]
block = \[dq]battery\[dq]
format = \[dq] $percentage {$time_remaining.dur(hms:true, min_unit:m) |}\[dq]
device = \[dq]DisplayDevice\[dq]
driver = \[dq]upower\[dq]
.EE
.PP
Hide missing battery:
.IP
.EX
\f[B][[block]]\f[R]
block = \[dq]battery\[dq]
missing_format = \[dq]\[dq]
.EE
