Update block on right click:
.IP
.EX
\f[B][[block]]\f[R]
block = \[dq]disk_space\[dq]
\f[B][[block.click]]\f[R]
button = \[dq]right\[dq]
update = true
.EE
.PP
Show the block only if less than 10GB is available:
.IP
.EX
\f[B][[block]]\f[R]
block = \[dq]disk_space\[dq]
format = \[dq] $free.eng(range:..10e9) |\[dq]
.EE
