.SS Example
Use \f[CR]swaynag\f[R] as a notifier:
.IP
.EX
\f[B][[block]]\f[R]
block = \[dq]pomodoro\[dq]
notify_cmd = \[dq]swaynag \-m \[aq]{msg}\[aq]\[dq]
blocking_cmd = true
.EE
.PP
Use \f[CR]notify\-send\f[R] as a notifier:
.IP
.EX
\f[B][[block]]\f[R]
block = \[dq]pomodoro\[dq]
notify_cmd = \[dq]notify\-send \[aq]{msg}\[aq]\[dq]
blocking_cmd = false
.EE
