\[lq]Thunderstorm\[rq] at night)
.SS xrandr
X11 screen information
.PP
X11 screen information (name, brightness, resolution, refresh rate).
With a click you can toggle through your active screens, and scrolling
the wheel up/down, you can adjust the selected screens\[cq] brightness.
Regarding brightness control, xrandr changes the brightness of the
display using gamma rather than changing the brightness in hardware, so
if that is not desirable, then consider using the \f[CR]backlight\f[R]
block instead.
.PP
NOTE: Some users report issues (e.g.\ \c
.UR https://github.com/greshake/i3status-rust/issues/274
here
.UE \c
\ and \c
.UR https://github.com/greshake/i3status-rust/issues/668
here
.UE \c
\ when using this block.
The cause is currently unknown, however, setting a higher update
interval may help.
