.SS Available icon sets
.IP \[bu] 2
\f[CR]none\f[R] (default.
Uses text labels instead of icons)
.IP \[bu] 2
\f[CR]awesome4\f[R] (Font Awesome 4.x)
.IP \[bu] 2
\f[CR]awesome5\f[R] (Font Awesome 5.x)
.IP \[bu] 2
